# A chain whose second literal runs past the limit is reflowed from its first literal on.
----------
class T {
  String s =
      "one long incredibly unbroken"
          + " sentence that went on through breakfast and lunch and dinner and long into the night moving from topic to topic so that"
          + " no-one sitting anywhere near the long dining table, not even the host or the cook, had a chance to"
          + " interrupt";
}
----------
class T {
    String s = "one long incredibly unbroken sentence that went on through breakfast and lunch and dinner and long"
            + " into the night moving from topic to topic so that no-one sitting anywhere near the long dining table,"
            + " not even the host or the cook, had a chance to interrupt";
}
